1. e4 e5 2. Nf3 d6 3. d4 Bg4 {Pinning the knight, but the bishop will soon have to give itself up.} 4. dxe5 Bxf3 (4... dxe5 5. Qxd8+ Kxd8 6. Nxe5 {wins a pawn.}) 5. Qxf3 dxe5 6. Bc4 {Every move develops with a threat.} Nf6 7. Qb3 Qe7 8. Nc3 c6 9. Bg5 b5 $6 10. Nxb5 $1 cxb5 11. Bxb5+ Nbd7 12. O-O-O Rd8 13. Rxd7 $1 Rxd7 14. Rd1 Qe6 15. Bxd7+ Nxd7 16. Qb8+ $3 {[%csl Gd8][%cal Rd1d8,Rb8d8] The queen sacrifice opens the d-file for the final blow.} Nxb8 17. Rd8# 1-0

